1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,750
Mars is 20 minutes away.

2
00:00:02,150 --> 00:00:03,050
Help is not.

3
00:00:03,250 --> 00:00:04,900
Meet BioNova.

4
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,900
A wearable sensor streams your heartbeat, oxygen.

5
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,450
Every organ is mapped to NASA's five space hazards.

6
00:00:13,050 --> 00:00:16,000
When something drifts, BioNova tells you what to do.

7
00:00:16,050 --> 00:00:20,450
Handle it yourself, alert the crew, or call the flight surgeon.

8
00:00:21,350 --> 00:00:24,550
Measure, understand, act. BioNova.

